  "content": "<h1><strong>此模組需要 Create 或 Sable 才能發揮功能</strong></h1><p>此模組新增了在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 機械裝置以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sable</a> 子層級中，能坐在來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[let's do] furniture</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/another-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">another furniture</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/handcrafted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">handcrafted</a> 等家具模組的家具上的功能（適用於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-aeronautics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Aeronautics</a>）。</p>",
